WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[182626] = "Use: Restore the following memory to the Runecarver:\n\n Phearomones\nYou and your minions gain 15% Haste while you are inside your Death and Decay and enemies damaged by your Death and Decay have a chance to cower in place for 3 sec."
