WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184016] = "Use: Become the Skulking Predator for 10 sec, gaining 21 Speed and pouncing on the next enemy to come within 8 yds, dealing 1,438 Physical damage. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184017] = "Use: Form a Huntsman's Bond with a target ally for 30 sec. 25% of damage you suffer will be redirected to your bonded ally, up to 4,228 total damage redirected. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184018] = "Equip: Absorbs up to 3,799 damage from a lethal attack. When this effect occurs, erupt in a burst of flames, inflicting 903 Fire damage to nearby allies and enemies, and recovering 2,608 health.\n\nThis effect can only occur once every 8 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184019] = "Use: Activate Soul Igniter, sacrificing up to 800 health over 15 sec to empower Blazing Surge.\n\nReactivate to cast Blazing Surge, dealing 572 Fire damage split between enemies in a 40 yd cone, plus up to 40% additional damage, based on how long Soul Igniter was active.\n\nDamage is increased per enemy struck, up to 5 enemies. (1 min Cooldown) (0 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184020] = "Use: Infuse your ally with a tuft of phoenix plumes, healing them for 1,930 after 6 sec, increased by up to 25% based on your target's missing health. If your ally suffers lethal damage, this effect triggers instantly. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184021] = "Use: Deal 875 Arcane damage to an enemy over 10 sec.\n\nIf your target dies while afflicted with Glyph of Assimilation, your Mastery is increased by 49 for 2 times the duration remaining on the Glyph. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184022] = "Equip: Casting a damaging spell causes your next single target heal to grant 42 Leech for 10 sec. This effect may only occur once every 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184023] = "Equip: Your damaging abilities have a high chance to deal 43 Physical damage, healing you for 300% of the damage dealt. If this effect overheals, deal 182 Physical damage split between nearby enemies over 15 sec, but suppress the lifesteal effect.\n\nDamage increased per enemy struck, up to 5 enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184024] = "Use: Four dance partners appear in a random pattern around you. Moving to each grants you 12 Haste and 6 Speed for 20 sec, stacking. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184025] = "Use: Your next 5 damaging abilities inflict Shattered Psyche, dealing 241 Shadow damage and increasing the target's damage taken from Shattered Psyche by 1% for 5 sec, stacking up to 25 times. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184026] = "Equip: While you have a greater health percentage than your target, your abilities have a very high chance to deal 67 Physical damage.\n\nWhile you have a lower health percentage than your target, your abilities have a very high chance to heal you for 92."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184027] = "Equip: Proclaim your allegiance to the Stone Legion, increasing your Versatility by 12, increased by 5% for each Stone Legionnaire in your party."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184028] = "Equip: Join the Crimson Chorus. Every minute, your Critical Strike swells by 38 over 30 sec. before returning to normal. This effect is increased by 5% for each member of the Crimson Chorus in your party."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[184029] = "Equip: For every 3,240 mana spent, store 96 healing within the mirror, up to 802 for 30 sec.\nUse: Heal your target for 551 plus all healing stored within the mirror. (1 Min Cooldown)"
