WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186229] = "Equip: Hot to the touch!"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186388] = "Equip: While you are behind your enemies, their movement is impaired, or they are suffering from loss-of-control effects, your attacks have a high chance to cause them to bleed for 237 Physical damage over 6 sec. (Requires level 60 or below)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186398] = "Equip: Your attacks apply Banshee's Blight, giving your finishing moves a 3% chance per combo point spent to deal 135 Shadow damage. Banshee's Blight stacks up to 4 times as the target becomes more injured. (Requires level 60 or below)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186404] = "Use: Answer the Call, joining the ranks of the Val'kyr. Your secondary stats are increased by 27 for 30 sec. (3 Min Cooldown) (Requires level 60 or below)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186410] = "Use: Consume a lesser weapon, destroying it utterly to feed the power of Jaithys."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186414] = "Equip: Gain the ability to fire a Wailing Arrow, which deals Shadow damage to your target and other nearby enemies and silences any creatures struck."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186421] = "Equip: Your damaging spells have a chance to increase your Critical Strike by 9 for 15 sec, stacking up to 3 times.\nUse: Raise the remains of a fallen ally as a skeletal warrior for 30 sec. (10 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186422] = "Use: Study the tome, learning the weakness of your targeted enemy. Your damaging abilities have a very high chance to deal 61 additional Shadow damage to your studied foe.\n\nStudying a new enemy removes the benefit of any prior studies. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186423] = "Equip: While your health is above 50% you are judged Worthy, increasing your highest secondary stat by 16. While your health is below 50% you are judged Unworthy, decreasing your highest secondary stat by 16."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186424] = "Use: Call upon Annhylde's Aegis for protection, reducing damage you take from enemies in front of you by 537 for 8 sec.\n\nIf the Aegis absorbs at least 1,882 damage, it becomes overcharged and will expel coalesced power, dealing 299 Holy damage to all enemies in front of you as it expires. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186425] = "Use: Reduce the remaining cooldown of an appropriate healing spell by 1 sec. \n\nValid only for healer specializations. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186427] = "Equip: A voice whispers to you, periodically compelling you to follow its instructions. If you comply, you will be rewarded with 47 of your highest secondary stat for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186428] = "Use: Gaze into the orb, suffering 1,348 Shadow damage over 2 sec to increase your Mastery by 67 for up to 40 sec. The longer you gaze, the more tormented and insightful you become. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186429] = "Equip: Your critical hits have a chance to increase your Strength or Agility by 43 for 15 sec. If you are below 50% health when this occurs, you also heal for 472 over 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186430] = "Equip: Your damaging spells and abilities have a chance to deal an additional 233 Shadow damage over 15 sec.\n\nIf a target dies while affected by the Tormentor's Rack Fragment, it leaves a Shredded Soul behind which you can collect to gain 4 Critical Strike for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186431] = "Use: Curse an enemy, dealing 81 Shadow damage every 1.8 sec for 12 sec. Duration increases by up to 100% based on their missing health. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)\n\n (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)\nEquip: If a target dies while affected by the Ebonsoul Vise, it leaves a Shredded Soul behind which you can collect to gain 4 Critical Strike for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186432] = "Use: Empower your weapons for 20 sec, causing your attacks to have a very high chance to deal 135 Arcane damage. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186433] = "Equip: Taking damage has a chance to trigger your Reactive Defense Matrix, which reflects the next 612 damage back at your attacker.\n\nReactive Defense Matrix triggers automatically when your health drops below 20% health. This effect cannot occur more than once per 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186434] = "Equip: If you are killed by no more than 4,381 damage, the Weave of Warped Fates will unwind your fate, returning yourself to life and healing for 4,418.\n\nThis effect can only occur once every 8 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186435] = "Equip: You have a chance to foresee damage taken by your allies, healing them instantly for 133 when they are injured."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186436] = "Equip: When you heal an ally who is below 50% health, a Spectral Feline will infuse them for an additional 674 healing. The Feline will reconstitute itself after 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186437] = "Equip: Your attacks have a high chance to deal 17 Frost damage and apply Frozen Heart to the enemy.\nUse: Call a Nerubian to ambush an enemy, impaling them for 647 Physical damage. Enemies in the Nerubian's path who are affected by your Frozen Heart suffer 54 Frost damage. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186438] = "Equip: While in combat your rage builds, increasing your Haste by 5 every 20 sec, stacking up to 5 times.\nEquip: When a nearby ally's health drops below 50%, sacrifice 240 of your health to heal them for the same amount. May only occur every 1 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186439] = "Equip: Every 10 shots, trigger Withering Fire, striking up to 5 enemies in front of you for 37 Shadow damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186445] = "Use: Restores the vitality of an ally."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186448] = "Use: Restores the vitality of an ally. (2 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186449] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon this companion."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186453] = "Use: Allows you to track and locate Stolen Anima Vessels while on assaults into the Maw."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186469] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon this mount.  This is a flying mount."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186470] = "Use: Teaches you how to craft an Optional Reagent that sets the required level to 60, item level to 230, and makes the item Unique Equipped.\n\nUsable with Shadowlands recipes for Rare (blue) armor and accessories."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186472] = "Use: Open your Companions page and use this item to grant 75,000 XP directly to a companion."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186473] = "Use: When summoned, Pepe will sometimes be dressed like a Night Fae. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[186474] = "Use: Throw a fae spear at a Mawsworn Harbinger, dragging it down to you. (6 Sec Cooldown)"
