WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[187228] = "Use: Restore the following memory to the Runecarver:\n\n Contained Perpetual Explosion\nImpending Catastrophe's damage over time is increased by 125% plus 15% for each enemy target hit on the way to its final target, to a maximum of 275%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[187229] = "Use: Restore the following memory to the Runecarver:\n\n Pact of the Soulstalkers\nWhen your Resonating Arrow deals damage to a target, your party gains 10% increased critical strike chance for 10 sec."
