WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188252] = "Use: Drive a spike into your target, dealing 1,689 Physical damage and creating a chain link between you for 20 sec. While the chain persists, 25% of all damage dealt to the target is stored within it, up to a maximum of 716.\n\nMoving away from your target will rip the chain out, dealing the stored amount as Shadow damage to all enemies within 8 yds of them. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188253] = "Equip: Affix a Domination Rune to yourself, gaining power at a price.\nUse: Add another. (30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188254] = "Use: Manifest a Quasar which orbits your target, blasting it with 860 Cosmic damage over 7 sec.\n\nAfter 7 sec, the Quasar stabilizes, creating an Event Horizon for 10 sec which grants you 65 Haste while within its perimeter. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188255] = "Use: Invoke the swarm, losing the ability to cast or attack but transforming into a swarm of hungering locusts, gaining 14 Speed and 72 Leech, and dealing 2,449 Shadow damage split between all nearby enemies over 3 sec.\n\nDamage is increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188261] = "Use: Establish a link deep within your target's mind, increasing your dodge rating by 45, and draining 1,495 health over 6 sec.\n\nIf the link is still intact when this effect ends, their mind shatters, dealing 259 Shadow damage to enemies within 8 yds of them and Horrifying them for 3 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188262] = "Use: Channel the Light for 3 sec, creating a zone of protection around you, absorbing 30% of all damage taken by allies within, up to a total of 7,326.\n\nYour critical heals have a chance to reduce the cooldown by 6 sec.\n\nValid only for healer specializations. (10 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188263] = "Equip: Whenever a nearby Automa dies, you exude Ephemera, healing up to 5 nearby allies for 301 over 30 sec.\nUse: Call forth an Automa Medic which restores 31 mana to you over 10 sec before expiring. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188264] = "Use: Cause the ground to quake beneath your feet, dealing 1,186 Nature damage split between all nearby enemies over 12 sec. Damage increased per target hit.\n\nWhile quaking, you can sense nearby tectonic weak points. Moving over a weak point will deal an additional 169 Nature damage to all nearby enemies. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188265] = "Equip: Periodically rummage through the cache, finding a new stolen weapon.\nUse: Grab the weapon from the cache, gaining its benefit. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188266] = "Use: Places a Rift Portal in front of you that charges for 1.5 sec before unleashing a blast of 464 Cosmic damage split between enemies in a line. The portal plunders reality itself, granting you a shield for 20 sec which absorbs 1,072 damage.\n\nDamage and absorption are increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188267] = "Equip: Your damaging abilities have a high chance to smell out the scent of delicious soul energy, stacking up to 100 times. At full stacks, a swarm of devourers burst forth, chomping your target for 1,530 Physical damage.\n\nEffects that cause your target to move generate bonus stacks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188268] = "Equip: Whenever a nearby Automa dies, your cooldowns recover 5% more quickly for 30 sec.\nUse: Call forth an Attendant Automa who channels 113 Cosmic damage onto your target over 8 sec, after which it expires. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188269] = "Equip: Taking damage has a chance to fabricate an ally from the Pocket Protoforge who interferes with your enemies' attacks, assisting in combat and absorbing 1,564 damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188270] = "Equip: Weep before the Eternals, dedicating yourself to their service.\n\nGain 13 of your highest secondary stat, and grant 10% of this bonus to any party members who also serve your covenant."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188271] = "Use: Gain the power of your Covenant Signature ability and gain 145 Versatility for 20 sec. (5 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188272] = "Use: Fire a resonant bolt at your target which causes a Disintegration Halo from its location, dealing 50 damage every 1.8 sec for 6 sec. Crescendos 3 times before taking it again from the top. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188273] = "Equip: Your healing spells and abilities have a chance to activate a Pre-Fabricated Assistant who applies 69 absorb to your most injured nearby ally every 1 sec for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188282] = "Use: Reduces the cost of your next spell cast within 10 sec by up to 755 mana. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188309] = "Use: Increases your Critical Strike by 155 for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188313] = "Equip: Reduces the duration of any Silence or Interrupt effects used against the wearer by 20%. This effect does not stack with other similar effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[188352] = "Use: Reduces damage from each attack by 3,022, up to a total of 22,345 damage absorbed.  Lasts 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"
