WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193628] = "Use: Summon an Unstable Arcane Rune at your location for 15 sec. While standing within, you or your party members gain power but suffer its corruption, increasing primary stat by 29 and decreasing Critical Strike by 27. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193634] = "Equip: Dealing or taking damage has a chance to grant you a stack of Brimming Life-Pod, up to 5.\nUse: Consume Brimming Life-Pod to gain 15 Versatility and 563 Maximum Health per stack consumed. Lasts 12 sec. (30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193639] = "Equip: Your abilities have a chance to crystallize your target, inflicting 252 Arcane damage over 12 sec. If the target dies while crystallized they explode, inflicting 356 Arcane damage split between all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193652] = "Use: Impale yourself with the splinter, immediately suffering 1,116 Nature damage but letting its slime loose over your body. The slime absorbs 50% of damage taken, up to 4,464 total damage, for 15 sec. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193660] = "Equip: Your ranged spells and abilities have a chance to unleash a volley of pure decay, dealing up to 647 Nature damage split between enemies hit and decreasing their movement speed by up to 30% for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193672] = "Equip: Your abilities have a low chance to summon a gnoll ally to assist you during combat. They may deal 1,099 Physical damage to your target and stun it for 2 sec, poison your target for 807 Nature over 10 sec, or increase your highest secondary stat by 48 for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193677] = "Equip: Your damaging spells have a chance to fire a Soulseeker Arrow towards your target, inflicting 960 Shadow damage over 20 sec. If the target dies while affected, your next damaging spells will fire an arrow."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193678] = "Use: Unleash the voice of Ohn'ahra to wrap an ally in wind, shielding them for 788 damage for 10 sec. When this effect ends the winds disperse and shield up to 4 nearby allies. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193679] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to call a centaur to aid you, increasing your party's Speed by 13 for 5 sec. The centaur charges forward, trampling enemies in a line for 973 Physical damage split between them."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193688] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to slash the target for 206 Nature damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193689] = "Equip: Taking damage has a low chance to grant you a shield, absorbing 1,127 damage for 20 sec, and increasing your Armor by 24 while the shield holds. The shield explodes when broken, dealing 237 Physical damage split between all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193697] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to cause spiraling winds to surround you, increasing your Agility by 3 every 2 sec, stacking up to 10 times before quickly dissipating. Lasts 25 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193700] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to strike out again, dealing 98 Physical damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193701] = "Use: Solve a puzzle, increasing your Mastery by 112 for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193718] = "Use: Select a target friendly player to coach. (1 Sec Cooldown)\nEquip: Your helpful spells and abilities have a chance to pep up you and your Coached ally, granting you both 31 Mastery for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193719] = "Use: Empty out the Dragon Games kickballs onto the field. Running into them kicks them at your enemy target, inflicting 1,387 Physical damage. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193732] = "Equip: Your harmful spells and abilities have a chance to impale the target with a shard of jagged ice, stacking up to 4.\nUse: Shatter all shards, dealing up to 681 Frost damage split between nearby enemies and decreasing their movement speed by up to 5% per stack for 10 sec. (30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193736] = "Use: Increase an ally's Armor by up to 143 and heal them for up to 956 over 8 sec. These effects are increased based on the current health of your target, and are most powerful on targets below 20% health. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193743] = "Use: Gain the Titans' crumbling power, increasing Intellect by 88, reduced each time you use an ability. Lasts 20 sec. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193748] = "Equip: Your helpful spells and abilities have a high chance to create a Burning Ember on an ally. The ember flares up after 1 sec, cauterizing wounds to heal for 1,244 and expelling 329 Fire damage split between nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193757] = "Equip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to call a Ruby Whelpling, which will try to be helpful and assist you in combat.\nUse: Call your Ruby Whelpling to inspect your target's situation, teaching them how to be helpful. (1 Day Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193762] = "Use: Bind with the blaze for 20 sec, giving your attacks a high chance to increase your Strength by 8, stacking up to 6 times. When your binding is complete, emit a burnout wave, dealing up to 2,395 Fire damage split between all nearby enemies, based on the strength of your binding. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193769] = "Use: Enkindle the fragment to throw an erupting spear which deals 1,026 Fire damage split between all enemies in the area. The erupted flames return to you for 10 sec, increasing your Critical Strike by 16 for each enemy struck, stacking up to 5 times. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193773] = "Use: Open the spoils and loot the first item you find to gain its fleeting power, increasing a secondary stat by 77 for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)\nEquip: Your spells have a chance to jostle the spoils, reordering the treasure within."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193785] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to ignite Forgestorm for 12 sec, causing your attacks to explode for 298 Fire damage split between all nearby enemies.\n\nDamage is increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[193786] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to cause flaming tentacles to grow from your body for 10 sec. The tentacles lash out, dealing 69 Fire damage every 2 sec split between enemies in front of you.\n\nDamage is increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies."
