WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194299] = "Use: Stomp the ground, commanding flames to radiate outward from your position, dealing 1,414 Fire damage split between all enemies struck and granting you a 2,641 shield for 30 sec. After a delay, the flames return, dealing the same damage and refreshing the shield.\n\nDamage and absorption are increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194300] = "Use: If your mana is above 65%, toss the Chillglobe at your target, inflicting 2,546 Frost damage.\n\nIf your mana is below 65%, instead drink from the Chillglobe to restore 228 mana instantly. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194301] = "Equip: Succumb to the Icon's whispers and become Infused with Frost, increasing your Critical Strike by 23. \n\nFighting alongside allies who are Infused with Earth or Fire has a chance to grant you 6 of their Infusion's stat for 12 sec.\n\nInfusion based on your current specialization."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194302] = "Use: Accept the storm, becoming a Primal Air Elemental and immobilizing yourself for 10 sec.\n\nWhile in this form, the winds around you deal 260 Nature damage per second to all enemies within 10 yards, intensifying by 10% each second until the transformation subsides. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194303] = "Equip: Your attacks slowly build Concussive Force, granting 1 attack power per stack. \n\nAt 10 stacks, your next 3 melee abilities emit a shockwave in front of you, dealing 756 bonus Nature damage to all enemies in a line. Shockwaves deal more damage to enemies at high health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194304] = "Use: Deal 1,839 Frost damage to your target, encasing them and nearby enemies in a Crystalline Web for 15 sec. Webbed enemies are slowed by 15% and take 145 Frost damage when any enemy in the web is struck. \n\nDamage is increased for each webbed enemy, up to 5. Damage per target is reduced beyond 5 enemies. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194305] = "Equip: Your critical strikes have a chance to build Static Electricity, granting 2% attack speed per stack. This effect may occur every 1 sec.\n\nAt 10 stacks lightning surges through you, increasing your movement speed by 30% for 12 seconds. While surging, your auto attacks jolt your target and 1 nearby enemy for 267 Nature damage.\n\nWhen this effect fades, you become grounded for 1 min and unable to generate Static Electricity."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194306] = "Equip: Enter an Elemental Stance. Successfully dodging or parrying an attack unleashes a powerful Elemental Counterattack to enemies in front of you as you assume the next stance.\n\nThis effect can only occur once every 30 seconds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194307] = "Use: Designate another player to bond with, becoming their Guardian for 1 hour.\n\nWhile bonded, you and your ally gain 4 Versatility and restore 23 health per second. If you are within 15 yards of one another, these bonuses are increased. \n\nValid only for healer specializations.\n (5 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194308] = "Use: Channel for 2 sec, unleashing a furious volley of flame around your target, dealing 6,371 Fire damage to your target with a chance to strike nearby enemies for additional damage.\n\nWhenever an allied player dies, this cooldown is reduced by 90 seconds. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194309] = "Equip: Casting spells and abilities builds stacks of Spite. At 5, a Spiteful Stormbolt arcs towards your current target, dealing 431 Nature damage over 3 sec.\n\nUpon expiration the bolt returns, increasing the amount of Spite needed by 1 and permanently increasing Spiteful Stormbolt's damage against them until either of you die."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194310] = "Equip: Casting spells grants stacks of Hatred, permanently lowering this trinket's cooldown by 1 second until combat ends. This effect stacks up to 180 times.\nUse: Let loose a dangerous current of lightning, dealing 4,920 Nature damage to your target and 26 Nature damage to yourself. Self-damage increases with your stacks of Hatred. (4 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194333] = "Equip: Your spells have a chance to wrap yourself in red magic, causing spells to deal 76 additional Fire damage to enemies or healing to allies for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[194334] = "Use: Create a soulbound Mythic Dungeon item appropriate for your loot specialization (Arcane) during Shadowlands Season 3."
