WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[200885] = "Use: Steeped from Hyjal's sparking flower petals, this brew is sure to put a pep or two in your step. Increases movement speed by 30% for 1 hour.\n\nOnly active while in the Dragon Isles. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
