WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202314] = "Use: Restores 46,875 health over 20 sec.\nMust remain seated while eating. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202315] = "Use: Restores 62,500 mana over 20 sec.\nMust remain seated while drinking. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202360] = "Use: Adds this toy to your Toy Box.\n\nAttach some garbage to your fishing hook and cast your line! You will probably not catch anything, but at least you will appear to be trying. (5 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202401] = "Use: Restores 360 health over 18 sec.  Must remain seated while eating.  If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 1 Stamina for 15 min. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202407] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon Flow."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202409] = "Use: Summon or dismiss Zalethgos to travel the Dragon Isles with you. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202411] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon Tremblor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202412] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon Wildfire."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202413] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon Vortex."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202569] = "Use: Ignite the Elder Flame to siphon the heat from nearby enemies, dealing 125 Fire damage to them and causing your melee abilities to unleash waves of ancient lava, dealing 377 Fire damage split between all enemies struck for 10 seconds. (2 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202606] = "Equip: Your auto-attacks have a low chance to strike again with violent purpose, dealing 881 Shadowflame damage. This damage is doubled against Humanoids."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202610] = "Use: Stick a Dragonfire Bomb to your target, dealing 1,088 Fire damage after 7 sec. If your target dies with a bomb attached, it deals 907 split between all enemies within 10 yards instead. Stores a maximum of 3 bombs. (30 Sec Cooldown)\n\nCritically striking 60 times triggers a flash of inspiration, allowing you to assemble an extra Bomb charge on the fly. (10 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202612] = "Equip: Your attacks and abilities have a chance to grant you ephemeral dragon wings, increasing your Critical Strike by 43 and your Leech by 12 for 15 sec.\nUse: Call upon an echo of Neltharion's power to crash to the ground below you, dealing 684 Shadowflame damage to nearby enemies if you have traveled at least 15 yards. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202613] = "Use: Hurl the grapnel up to 20 yds to impale your target, dealing 1,894 Physical damage and heaving you towards them with tremendous force. On impact, deal 2,578 Volcanic damage split between all nearby enemies. \n\nImpact damage is increased per enemy struck, up to 5 enemies. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202614] = "Equip: Your healing spells have a chance to awaken the Heart, restoring 63 mana over 10 sec and causing your healing spells to restore 441 additional health over 10 sec.\n\nOverhealing from this effect invigorates your target, granting them up to 16 Versatility for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202615] = "Equip: Your harmful spells have a high chance to draw unstable flames from the Vessel, increasing your Haste by 3 and dealing 73 Fire damage to you over 30 sec.\n\nUpon reaching 5 stacks the flames leap toward your target, combusting immediately for 1,584 Shadow damage, then burning them for 2,376 Shadowflame damage over 12 seconds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202616] = "Use: Cover yourself with 5 Hellsteel Plates, reducing damage taken by 165 and your movement speed by 3% per plate, for 15 sec. \n\nTaking 1,375 damage ruptures one plate, removing it and releasing forth a pillar of Shadowflame that deals 607 damage to all enemies in its path. This effect may only occur once every 2 sec. Upon expiration, all remaining plates rupture. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202617] = "Equip: Sharpen your weapon with Elementium, giving your melee damage dealer specialization's main class ability a chance to deal 704 additional Shadowflame damage on-hit.\nUse: Strike your weapon against the anvil to strengthen it further, dealing 224 Shadowflame damage to nearby enemies and increasing the on-hit damage by 33% until shortly after leaving combat. Stacks 5 times. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202620] = "Use: Consume to reduce toxicity by a large amount. (5 Sec Cooldown)"
