WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207390] = "Use: Shield an ally for 3,764 while channeling a beam of molten flame dealing 442  Fire damage over 2.5 sec to them. If they survive the channel, heal them for 9,411. (2 Min Cooldown)"
