WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207528] = "Equip: Sustaining fatal damage throws you 10 seconds into the past, restoring up to 19,102 health lost during that time.\n\nFor the next 12 sec, your Haste is increased by 114 and enemies responsible for your untimely demise deal 20% less damage to you.\n\nThis effect can only occur once every 8 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207552] = "Use: Activate the Tyrstone, recording 30% of your healing done over the next 10 sec, up to 5,630 healing done. (2 Min Cooldown)\nEquip: Whenever you or one of your allies falls below 35% health, the Tyrstone will summon an echo of your past self, healing them for the stored amount split among nearby allies and granting 8 Haste for 15 sec before the record is lost. Deals increased healing when healing multiple allies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207561] = "Equip: Poisons target for 1 Nature damage every 2 sec for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207566] = "Equip: Your attacks drain the hourglass, giving you a chance to gain 3 Haste up to 8 times before the sand runs out.\n\nOnce the glass is empty, your next offensive ability performs a flurry of Accelerated Strikes, dealing 95 Physical damage per stack and flipping the Hourglass to begin the cycle anew."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207579] = "Use: \"Borrow\" power from an alternate timeline for personal gain, increasing your Haste by 79 for 15 sec and triggering a Paradox 2 min later.\n\nIf the Paradox arrives, you will be frozen in time, completely unable to act or move for 5 sec. Killing enemies steals their remaining time to partially delay the Paradox by 15 sec, with major enemies restoring the timeline completely. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207581] = "Use: Gaze into the mirror's depths, inviting a version of your future self to fight alongside you for 20 sec, casting spells based on your role. In addition, you grant yourself 118 of your highest secondary stat. (3 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207591] = "Use: Place a Spare Harvest Torch in the ground to provide light to all that stand near it.\n\nUsable in Light's Blooming and the nearby keyflame areas.\n (5 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207728] = "Equip: Wield the might of The Blazing, becoming enveloped in its Shadowflame."
