WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212384] = "Use: Collect 15 Drake's Awakened Crests. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212449] = "Equip: Assume a martial stance based on the last weapon drawn.\nUse: Surekian Flourish \nConjure dual swords from the Arsenal to rend your target, dealing 2,944 Shadow damage over 3 sec. Gain 8 Parry and 5 Avoidance until the next weapon is drawn.\n (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212450] = "Equip: Your attacks and abilities have a high chance to summon a scarab that retrieves a fortifying chunk of flesh from your target. Scarabs deal 68 Physical damage and reduce your damage taken by 50% until 1,704 damage has been prevented.\nUse: Send your swarm into a frenzy, summoning 12 scarabs over 3 sec to ravage your foes. The number of scarabs is increased by your Haste. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212451] = "Equip: Accumulate dark power from the Spellforge every 15 sec to empower your next Arcane Barrage to deal 308 additional Shadow damage.\nUse: Recklessly intensify the power of the Spellforge, multiplying its current damage by 125% until shortly after leaving combat, up to 5 times. At full power, gain 20 Haste for 6 sec when empowering your Arcane Barrage. \n\nBeware glimpses of the Unseeming. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212452] = "Equip: Your healing spells have a high chance to cause you to inject yourself with a charge of Volatile Serum. Multiple charges may overlap.\n\nIf an ally drops below 70% health, expel a charge to heal them for 2,376. If unconsumed after 15 sec, charges catalyze to grant you 25 Intellect for 10 sec instead."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212453] = "Use: Spray your target with volatile acid, dealing 33 Nature damage every 1 sec for 20 sec. \n\nYour abilities intensify the acid's damage by an additional 33 per sec for the remaining duration and splash up to 5 nearby enemies for 3 Nature damage per stack. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212454] = "Use: Take what is rightfully yours, gorging on your target's essence to deal 21,441 Shadow damage and healing you for 3,165 over 2 sec. Damage and healing increased based on the target's missing health.\n\nCooldown reduced by 60 sec if this effect kills the target. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212456] = "Equip: Your abilities have a high chance to summon a phantom ethereal, dealing 664 Shadow damage to your target and 60 Shadow damage to all other enemies caught in its path. \n\nIf the target is below 35% health, this effect summons two additional phantoms at 25% effectiveness."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212491] = "Use: Restores 53,571 health over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and and gain the Sweet Eclipse buff, allowing you to increase Crit Chance 3% for each enemy killed when fighting in the shadows.\n\nUsable in Light's Blooming and nearby keyflame areas."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212492] = "Use: Restores 53,571 health over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating. If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become Well Fed, increase movement speed by 15%, and gain water walking while in Light's Blooming and nearby keyflame areas.\n\nUsable in Light's Blooming and nearby keyflame areas."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212500] = "Use: Adds this toy to your Toy Box.\n\nPull out a fancy white parasol for 15 min, allowing you to safely float down the next time you fall. (5 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[212517] = "Use: Can't stop rolling! Move at rapid speed for a short duration. \n\nJumping or running into other units will cause the barrel to explode! Can roll on water."
