WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219278] = "Weave this thread into your Cloak of Infinite Potential permanently increasing your Speed by 12."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219279] = "Weave this thread into your Cloak of Infinite Potential permanently increasing your Leech by 12."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219280] = "Weave this thread into your Cloak of Infinite Potential permanently increasing your Mastery by 12."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219281] = "Weave this thread into your Cloak of Infinite Potential permanently increasing your Versatility by 12."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219282] = "Weave this thread into your Cloak of Infinite Potential permanently increasing your Experience gained by 12%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219286] = "Use: Allows you to summon Globe Yetis using the Box of Puntables toy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219289] = "Use: Allows you to summon Tiny Snowmen using the Box of Puntables toy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219291] = "Use: Allows you to summon Baby Greenches using the Box of Puntables toy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219294] = "Use: Hold out the feather for 1 sec to strike with the power of the storm, crashing down on the target location and inflicting 2,868 Nature damage split between nearby enemies. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219295] = "Equip: Your abilities have a chance to call an earthen ally to your aid, supporting you in combat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219296] = "Equip: Your spells have a chance to destabilize the void energy, releasing a corrupted fragment. Retrieving a fragment briefly infuses you with its power, increasing your Intellect by 41 for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219297] = "Equip: Occasionally share a drink with allies who assist you in combat, granting them 20 of their primary stat for 15 sec and absorbing 861 damage. You take a sip as well, granting 10 Intellect and absorbing 4,423 damage.\n\nWhen you fall below 50% health, you take an emergency sip. This may only occur once every 1 min.\n\nValid only for tank specializations."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219298] = "Use: Call in a ravenous ally and ride off into the sunset (or 15 yds, whichever is closest), inflicting 3,431 Fire damage split between all enemies you ride through. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219299] = "Equip: Your spells have a chance to charge the device and request a Backfill Barrel near your target's location. Damaging the barrel causes it to explode, inflicting 1,932 Fire damage split between nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219300] = "Use: Grasp the shard tightly to enrich yourself with crystalline energy, increasing your Mastery by 108 for 15 sec. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)\nEquip: The shard draws in remnant energy from defeated enemies, increasing your Mastery by 2 for 15 sec, up to 5 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219301] = "Use: Launch the superheated gear-a-rang,  inflicting 1,869 Flamestrike damage to enemies, losing heat as it cuts through them. (2 Min Cooldown)\nEquip: Your melee attacks have a chance to crank the launcher's gears, decreasing its cooldown by 5 sec and heating up your weapon which causes your next attack to inflict 1,052 additional Fire damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219302] = "Equip: Your healing abilities have a chance to call the nearby metal to form a shield around an ally, absorbing 1,038 damage.\n\nThe shield reacts explosively to fire, inflicting 187 Fire damage to nearby enemies when struck."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219303] = "Use: Charge the crystal to summon a rift that draws power from nearby enemies, inflicting 12,206 Shadow damage over 6 sec.\n\nWhen the rift collapses, its drawn energy returns to you to increase your Intellect by 3 for 20 sec, further increased for each enemy struck. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219304] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to direct a Kobold Cart towards your target, sending a careening troop that collides with enemies, inflicting 1,401 Physical damage split between enemies impacted."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219305] = "Equip: Your spells have a chance to imbue the wax, causing it to form into a blazing candle for 15 sec which increases your Versatility by 50, further increased by 13 while you remain within its light."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219306] = "Use: Carve a wax copy of your target, which absorbs 50% of their damage taken. The absorption heats up the wax, causing it to melt after absorbing 6,074 damage. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219307] = "Equip: Your abilities have a chance to call the Darkness to you, increasing your Intellect by 8, up to 41.\n\nUpon reaching full power, the Darkness is unleashed, inflicting 8,102 Shadow damage split between nearby enemies over 15 sec before fading back into the remnant."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219308] = "Use: Raise your signet to the Light, increasing your highest secondary stat by 108 for 20 sec. Your act inspires nearby signetbearers within your party, granting them 2 of the same stat for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219309] = "Equip: Advance to the 50 Verses of Inner Resilience, reading as you are attacked.\nInner Resilience increases your armor by 56 and grants your attacks a chance to invoke a ward which absorbs 3,058 Magic damage. When finished, sift through the passages to another chapter.\n\nValid only for tank specializations.\nUse: Sift through the passages in the tome with increased Radiance. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219310] = "Use: Summon a Bursting Lightspawn which sacrifices its health to unleash Bursts of Light, inflicting 1,310 Holy damage split between nearby enemies every 2 sec while it lives. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219311] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to call to the pact, exploding for 812 Shadow damage split between nearby enemies and increasing your Haste by 14 for 10 sec.\n\nYour death breaks the pact, causing a violent explosion."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219312] = "Equip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to let loose a nascent empowerment from the crystal, increasing a random secondary stat by 54 for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219313] = "Use: Release a toll of holy light upon the target, inflicting 1,239 Holy damage. The next 5 allies to attack the target will receive the Blessing of Mereldar, increasing their Versatility by 25 for 10 sec. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219314] = "Equip: Your abilities have a chance to stir the sac, releasing an egg which grants you 6 Intellect. Each egg hatches after 1 min, and the new brood attacks your next target, inflicting 647 Nature damage over 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219315] = "Equip: Your taunt abilities activate the module's refracting energy, protecting you from 50% of damage taken, up to 6,929. This may only occur once every 1 min.\n\nValid only for tank specializations."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219316] = "Equip: The gland releases pheromones that attract a Ceaseless Swarm of insects to surround you. Taking damage has a high chance to retaliate against attackers, inflicting 376 Nature damage over 6 sec and reducing damage dealt to you by 86."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219317] = "Equip: Your damaging spells and abilities have a chance to send an orb of volatile black blood drifting to your target, exploding for 1,284 Shadow damage split between all nearby enemies on impact. Intercepting the orb allows you to siphon its power, instead increasing your Mastery by 65 for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219318] = "Equip: Your attacks have a chance to stir the larynx, allowing its dark whispers to influence you. Each whisper flows through your mind for 30 sec, granting 5 Strength.\nUse: Wave the larynx in the air to release a tormenting chorus, inflicting 4,023 Shadow damage over 3 sec split between nearby enemies. Your whispers leave to join the chorus, increasing its damage before falling silent. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219319] = "Use: Open the pouch and draw Nx's shadow blade to quickly strike at enemies in front of you, inflicting 530 Shadow damage to all enemies hit.\n\nYou may use the pouch up to two additional times within 20 sec before it seals itself to magically recharge its contents. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219320] = "Equip: Your excessive healing attracts nearby shadow energy to your party, storing up to 193 healing and restoring the target's health when they receive damage.\nUse: Channel the coaglam's power, concentrating all current shadow energy to shield your target. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219321] = "Equip: Your spells have a chance to inspire you to experiment on an ally, enhancing them in unforeseen ways for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219322] = "Use: Throw the potion at an unwitting guard to test its efficacy. (10 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219323] = "Use: Throw the potion at an unwitting guard to test its efficacy. (10 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219324] = "Use: Throw the potion at an unwitting guard to test its efficacy. (10 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219382] = "Equip: Your harmful and helpful spells have a chance to weave a Thread of Fate between you and your target for 5 sec. Tethered allies gain 18 bonus primary while the Thread holds and enemies take 641 Cosmic Damage when the Thread breaks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219385] = "Use: Administer the Antiparalytic Serum to a target paralyzed by The Puppetmaster's draught. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219386] = "Equip: Learn the following spell.\n\n Locus of Power\nChannel arcane power for 4 sec. Every 0.40 sec, infuse yourself and 2 allies within 50 yards with Haste, Critical Strike, and Mastery for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219387] = "Use: Adds this toy to your Toy Box.\n\nDeploy a dangerous barrel of fireworks for 5 min so you and your friends can violently illuminate the night sky!\n\nOther players can opt-in to seeing the fireworks by attacking the barrel.\n\nCooldown reduced during drunken goblin revelries. (1 Hr Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219388] = "Use: Rally a nearby group of Arathi with their faith in the Sacred Flame!"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219389] = "Equip: Your abilities have a chance to apply Lightning Rod to your target. Allies are granted Critical Strike for 10 sec and enemies suffer Nature damage every 1.6 sec for 8 sec. When Lightning Rod ends, it returns to you, granting Critical Strike for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219390] = "Use: Set the dungeon map of a Mythic Keystone to Grim Batol.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219391] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon this mount."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219392] = "Use: Reveal a flamethrower to deal Fire damage in a cone in front of you for 3 sec. Works against the Mmarl invasive nest-makers. (6 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219400] = "Use: Burn the corpse of a fallen defender. Leave nothing for the nerubians to defile!"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219403] = "Use: Adds this toy to your Toy Box.\n\nPlace a lantern to illuminate your surroundings and calm your spirits. The heat is just strong enough to also allow for cooking. (5 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219450] = "Use: Teaches you how to summon this mount."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219452] = "Equip: Store Static Charge every 10 sec. Moving releases the Static Charge healing allies or damaging enemies, 3 in total, preferring injured allies. Enemies suffer damage equal to the Static Charge and allies are healed for 150% of the Static Charge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219469] = "Use: Puts a tracker on a fog beast. Only works if the target doesn't already have a tracker. (3 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219489] = "Equip: Healing an ally has a chance to grant you both a Unifying Ember. When two Unifying Embers contact each other, they erupt into Unifying Flames.\n\nUnifying Flames grants the wearer 9 of their highest secondary stat, and others 1 of a random secondary stat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219492] = "Equip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to bring the power of the Light to bear against your foes. A Spark of Beledar judges them, dealing 380 Radiant damage while marking them. Your next Spark against them will consume the mark to deal an additional 326 Radiant damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219501] = "Equip: Dealing damage has a chance to grant you a stack of Deepening Darkness. The Darkness erupts at 5 stacks, dealing 1,588 Shadow damage split among all nearby enemies. Damage increases per target, up to 5. Afterwards, the shadows weigh you down and lower your movement speed by 15% for 5 sec.\n\nThis is a Nerubian embellishment."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219502] = "Equip: Taking damage has a chance to grant you an Adrenal Surge, causing you to gain 10 Intellect and lose 2 Mastery for 12 sec.\n\nThis is a Nerubian embellishment."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219516] = "Equip: Your movement speed is increased by 5% and you have immunity to falling damage. Your abilities have a chance to increase your party's Haste for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219523] = "Equip: Casting your major class cooldown causes you to overload, inflicting Nature damage and stunning enemies within 40 yards for 2 sec. (60 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219525] = "Use: Channeling nourishing waters into the nearby mosswools."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219527] = "Equip: Your Leech is increased by 10%. Grant 10% of your Leech to your party."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219672] = "Equip: Your damaging spells and abilities have the chance to ignite your target with Radiant Focus for 15 sec. \n\nAfter dealing up to 11,188 damage to the target, the focused energies ignite you with Radiance, granting between 11 to 21 of your highest secondary stat based on damage dealt for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219777] = "Equip: Reduces magic damage taken by 75% and redirects the next harmful spell targeting an ally within 40 yards to you.\n\n3 sec after taking magic damage or redirecting a spell this effect will be suppressed for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219801] = "Equip: Suffering lethal damage will return you to life with 10% health. This effect can only prevent damage up to 2 times your maximum health. This effect can only occur once every 2 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219817] = "Equip: Avoidance increased by 20%.\nAllies within 40 yards will immediately be purified of loss of control effects. This effect can only occur once every 45 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219818] = "Equip: Versatility increased by 0%.\nParty members within 40 yards recuperate 0% of their class resource every 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219861] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Herbalism Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219862] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Skinning Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219863] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Skinning Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219864] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Engineering Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219865] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Leatherworking Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219866] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Alchemy Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219867] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Herbalism Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219868] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Skinning Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219869] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Skinning Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219870] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Engineering Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219871] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Leatherworking Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219872] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Alchemy Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219873] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Blacksmithing Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219874] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Blacksmithing Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219875] = "Equip: +5 Khaz Algar Jewelcrafting Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219876] = "Equip: +11 Khaz Algar Jewelcrafting Skill"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219877] = "Equip: Your attacks have a high chance to apply Queensbane to your target, dealing 475 Shadow damage over 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219878] = "Equip: Learn the following spell.\n\n Tireless Spirit\nGrants party members within 40 yards Tireless Spirit for 5 sec, reducing the resource cost of abilities by 100%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219905] = "Use: Increases Haste by 15% for all party and raid members. Lasts 40 sec.\n\nAllies receiving this effect will become Exhausted and be unable to benefit from Bloodlust, Heroism, or similar effects again for 10 min. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219906] = "Use: Apply a Defender's Armor Kit to your leg armor, permanently increasing its Agility or Strength by 6. Additionally, the item also gains 8 armor. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219907] = "Use: Apply a Defender's Armor Kit to your leg armor, permanently increasing its Agility or Strength by 7. Additionally, the item also gains 9 armor. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219908] = "Use: Apply a Defender's Armor Kit to your leg armor, permanently increasing its Agility or Strength by 8. Additionally, the item also gains 10 armor. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219909] = "Use: Apply a Stormbound Armor Kit to your leg armor, causing it to permanently gain 6 Agility or Strength. Additionally, the item also gains 6 Stamina. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219910] = "Use: Apply a Stormbound Armor Kit to your leg armor, causing it to permanently gain 7 Agility or Strength. Additionally, the item also gains 7 Stamina. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219911] = "Use: Apply a Stormbound Armor Kit to your leg armor, causing it to permanently gain 8 Agility or Strength. Additionally, the item also gains 8 Stamina. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219912] = "Use: Apply a Dual Layered Armor Kit to your leg armor, causing it to permanently gain 4 Agility or Strength. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219913] = "Use: Apply a Dual Layered Armor Kit to your leg armor, causing it to permanently gain 5 Agility or Strength. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219914] = "Use: Apply a Dual Layered Armor Kit to your leg armor, causing it to permanently gain 6 Agility or Strength. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219915] = "Use: Inject an enemy with digestive venom, dealing 2,580 Nature damage over 20 sec. While active, your attacks and abilities against the target restore 134 health. Cannot occur more than every 1 sec. \n\nOverhealing from this effect permanently increases your maximum health by the same amount, becoming an absorb shield upon leaving combat. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219917] = "Use: Feed the Coagulum, redirecting 20% of all healing done until 4,724 healing has been consumed. Once sated, the Coagulum bursts to heal 5 allies for 3,335.\n\nLingering effluvia causes affected allies' next attacks to deal an additional 84 Shadow damage, increased based on overhealing done by the Coagulum. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219919] = "Equip: Dealing Fire damage has a chance to apply Seething Hate, causing 86 Shadow damage split between them and other nearby enemies over 9 sec.\n\nDamage is increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219920] = "Use: Mould and show off some pottery!"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219923] = "Equip: Dealing Fire damage has a chance to apply Seething Hate, causing 86 Shadow damage split between them and other nearby enemies over 9 sec.\n\nDamage is increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219931] = "Use: Removes all movement impairing effects and all effects which cause loss of control of your character. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219932] = "Equip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to grant 37 primary stat for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219933] = "Use: Increases maximum health by 4,169 for 15 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219939] = "Use: Drain the essense of a Kobyss Deepspeaker within 20 yds. (3 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219940] = "Use: Launches the user far into the distance as a blazing meteor. (30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219941] = "Equip: Your harmful and helpful spells have a chance to weave a Thread of Fate between you and your target for 5 sec. Tethered allies gain 18 bonus primary while the Thread holds and enemies take 641 Cosmic Damage when the Thread breaks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219943] = "Use: Activate the Lamplighter firearm, setting fire to moth eggs in front of the caster. (10 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219944] = "Equip: 10% of damage taken grants you Healing Blood, up to 200% of your max health. Every 3 sec, Healing Blood is expended to heal you if you are injured."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[219960] = "Use: Vacuum Overladen Drone. (3 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220117] = "Equip: Learn the following spell.\n\n Ward of Salvation\nRestore health to an ally and grant them a Ward of Salvation for 8 sec.\n\nWhile Ward of Salvation persists, the caster's healing grants absorb in addition to healing.\n\nWhen the Ward expires, it explodes inflicting Holy damage equal to the remaining absorb to all enemies within 40 yards, split evenly."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220118] = "Use: Deploy an explosive barrel to bring righteous flame to the enemies of Arathor, dealing 3,535 Fire damage split between all enemies caught in the blast. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220120] = "Equip: Learn the following spell.\n\n Soul Tether\nTether your soul to an ally for 1 hour, redirecting 20% of their damage taken to you as Shadow damage. This effect can be used on up to 5 allies. Recasting on a tethered ally or moving further than 100 yards away removes the effect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220122] = "Use: Combine Offering of Pure Water and Jar of Mucus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220123] = "Use: Begin an ominous ritual."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220124] = "Use: Combine Offering of Pure Water and Jar of Mucus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220134] = "Use: Throw the fish back into the water to gain 10 Khaz Algar Fishing for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple fish can extend this buff up to 5 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220135] = "Use: Throw this fish back into the water and gain a stack of Bloody Chum attracting Sanguine Dogfish to your location for 5 min.\n\nThis effect increases your odds by 10% and stacks up to 10 times. Movement will cause your scent to be lost and cancel the effect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220136] = "Use: Throw the fish back into the water to gain 45 Perception for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple fish can extend this buff up to 5 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220137] = "Use: Throw the fish back into the water to gain 10 Khaz Algar Fishing for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple fish can extend this buff up to 5 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220138] = "Use: Throw the fish back into the water to gain 45 Perception for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple fish can extend this buff up to 5 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220139] = "Use: Toss the Whispering Stargazer into the waters of Azj-Kahet and awaken the fish that slumber below."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220145] = "Use: Smack your enemy with the Hammerfish and stun it for 1 sec. Only usable outdoors in Khaz Algar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220146] = "Use: Throw this fish back into the water for and gain a stack of Royal Chum, protecting the waters around you from Corrupted Ghoulfish and increasing the likelihood to catch Queen's Lurefish for 30 sec.\n\nThrowing multiple Regal Dottyback can extend this buff up to 10 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220148] = "Use: Open the contents of the Huskfish's stomach."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220152] = "Curses any Angler unfortunate enough to reel this in.\nUse: Throw this fish back into the water, cleansing the Ghoulfish Curse and gaining 15 Perception for 15 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220156] = "Use: Coats your weapons in a Bubbling Wax that lasts for until canceled. Applying poisonous effects to your target has a chance to spill a 4 yd wide pool of boiling wax on top of the target, dealing 404 Fire damage split between enemies.\n\nDamage is increased for each enemy struck, up to 5 enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220161] = "Use: Place a suspiciously vile looking candle. (5 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220202] = "Equip: Your damaging spells dispatch a spider to spy on your foes, increasing your Intellect by 1 per report received. Stacks up to 40 times. This effect may only occur every 6 sec.\nUse: Use your accumulated knowledge to strike when the time is right, granting 3 Intellect per report for 20 sec and consuming their passive effect. (20 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220211] = "Equip: Learn the following spell.\n\n Precipice of Madness\nShroud your party members within 40 yards with Void, granting them a shield absorbing damage for 20 sec and reducing their health to 10%. Damage taken from this effect is added to the absorb."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220304] = "Equip: Your abilities have a chance to awaken the powers of the races of Northrend, temporarily transforming you and increasing your combat capabilities for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220305] = "Equip: Carefully balance the Egg's incubation. While stationary, gain 1 Intellect every 1 sec, up to 30 times. Diminishes while moving. While moving, gain 2 of your highest secondary stat every 1 sec, up to 30 times. Diminishes while stationary. \n\nAdditional stacks above 20 grant 60% reduced benefit.\nUse: Suspend the Egg's incubation state for 20 sec. (2 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220367] = "Use: Combine 3 of this gem to create a more powerful gem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220368] = "Use: Combine 3 of this gem to create a more powerful gem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220370] = "Use: Combine 3 of this gem to create a more powerful gem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220371] = "Use: Combine 3 of this gem to create a more powerful gem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220372] = "Use: Combine 3 of this gem to create a more powerful gem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220374] = "Use: Combine 3 of this gem to create a more powerful gem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220483] = "Use: Tune the nearby ward for Archmage Drenden."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220692] = "Use: Adds this toy to your Toy Box.\n\nPlace an X-treme Water Blaster Display. (30 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[220755] = "Use: Collect the Deep Stormhammer and the Frenzied Stormhammer appearances."
