WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[230019] = "Use: Summon Pitbot Geardo to assist you for 5 sec, coating nearby enemies with rancid motor oil for additional threat. Geardo ensures you take the blame.\n\nGeardo departs explosively to deal 3,314 Fire damage split between nearby enemies, increased by 15% if recently oiled. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[230026] = "Equip: Falling below 60% health surrounds you with a protective vortex of junk, reducing damage taken by 50% for 15 sec or until 4,725 damage is prevented. This effect may only occur every 30 sec.\n\nAfter 20 sec without activating while in combat, the Scrapfield overloads to energize you with 56 Haste for 12 sec.\nValid only for tank specializations."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[230027] = "Use: Deal yourself in, granting you 127 to 155 Mastery for 15 sec and stacking the deck. Stacking the deck increases the minimum Mastery on future hands by 5 until you leave combat, up to 3 times. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[230029] = "Use: Rapidly deploy the bomb suit to reduce damage taken by 75% for 20 sec or until 42,824 damage has been prevented.\n\nUpon depletion, the bomb suit detonates to deal 2,510 Fire damage split between nearby enemies. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
