WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[239084] = "Use: Apply Lesser Rune of Gushing Wound to a helm.\n\nYour damaging spells and abilities have a chance to cause your target to ooze blood for 1,548 damage over 7 sec. \n\nCannot be applied to items lower than level 350. This effect is fleeting and will only work during The War Within Season 2."
