WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[239088] = "Use: Apply Lesser Rune of the Twisted Appendage to a helm. \n\nYour attacks have a chance to spawn a tentacle which Mind Flays your target for 557 Shadow damage every second for 10 sec. \n\nCannot be applied to items lower than level 350. This effect is fleeting and will only work during The War Within Season 2."
