WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[242664] = "Equip: [Your spells and abilities have a chance to turn you into a Lightning Rod striking a random enemy target within 40 yds for 484 Nature damage every 3 sec for 15 sec.][Your spells and abilities have a chance to turn you into a Lightning Rod causing strikes that heal the lowest health friendly target within 40 yds for 1,304 every 3 sec for 15 sec.][Your spells and abilities have a chance to trigger Critical Overload, increasing your Critical Strike by 20 every 2 sec for 20 sec. ][Your spells and abilities have a chance to trigger a Spark Burst granting you 91 Haste for 20 sec. ][Your spells and abilities have a chance to grant you Static Charge, increasing your Versatility by $1236137w5*$1236938u${$1236137w5*$1236938u} for 30 sec. Each of your next spells and abilities reduce the Versatility bonus by 5%.][You gain Electric Current upon entering combat, increasing your Mastery by 5 every 2 sec up to a maximum of 66 after 24 sec then cycling back down and repeating.][Your heals have a chance to Spark jumping to the lowest health target within 40 yds, healing them for 5,116.][When you take damage, you have a chance to gain a Titan Energy Shield preventing up to 10,611 damage for 10 sec. When the shield expires it deals 30% of the remaining absorb as Arcane damage split between enemies within 8 yds. ][Your spells and attacks have a chance to send a Charged Bolt at your target that deals 2,796 Nature damage split between targets within 8 yds.]\nUse: Open the device."
