WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[242867] = "Equip: Your harmful attacks, spells, and abilities have a chance to engage the dispenser dropping 2 footbombs on the field for 10 sec.\n\nRunning into a footbomb kicks it at your current target dealing 1,068 Fire damage to all enemies in a 6-yard radius."
