WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[244790] = "Equip: +18 Midnight Fishing\nEquip: Become a snake when underwater in Midnight Zones, allowing you to breathe water and swim rapidly.\nEquip: Successful fishing attempts in the waters of The Coiled Isle will siphon Venom into The Coiled Huntress.\n\n+0 Venom\n\n  Shed Skin\n\nSpeak to Seasage Polo to invoke a ritual and turn your Venom into Coiled Filament. This also alters the rod's appearance, if able."
