WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[249805] = "Equip: You have a high chance to spatter your target with volatile phlegm, dealing 4 Nature damage per sec and stacking up to 5 times.\n\nUpon 5 stacks or the enemy's demise, the phlegm violently consumes itself to deal 371 Nature damage split between nearby enemies. Damage increased by 30% per additional enemy, up to 150%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[249806] = "Equip: The Plume's radiance grants you 30 Mastery, waning over 60 sec before reigniting to full incandescence. The Plume's power also regenerates while out of combat.\nUse: While out of combat, invoke the Plume's dual nature to transform it into an Umbral Plume. (5 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[249807] = "Equip: Your abilities have a chance to grant you a protective shell, absorbing up to 25% of incoming damage for 6 sec or until 1,197 damage has been prevented. If the shell expires without breaking, gain 41 Haste for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[249808] = "Use: Invoke the litany to apply Beacon of Lightblind Wrath to an enemy for 30 sec. Your next 5 harmful spells call down a blast of Light to deal 289 Holy damage to the target.\n\n5 injured allies are shielded for the same amount, absorbing 50% of damage taken while the shield holds. (1 Min 30 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[249809] = "Equip: Casting spells has a high chance to tempt you with the power of the Void, increasing your Intellect by 19 for 10 sec.\n\nEach temptation permanently increases this effect by 5%, up to 10 times, diminishing quickly upon leaving combat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[249810] = "Equip: Your harmful spells have a high chance to call cosmic shards from the heavens to slice your target and one nearby enemy for 385 Cosmic damage.\n\nIf either enemy is below 35% health, gain 14 Haste for 12 sec as you speed them to their fate."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[249811] = "Equip: Your healing has a high chance to inflict Cosmic Crescendo on a nearby enemy, dealing 1 Cosmic damage every 3 sec until their death, stacking up to 25 times.\n\nHum a cosmic hymn every 2 sec, consuming a Cosmic Crescendo stack if any ally is below 60% health to heal them and up to 4 injured allies for 228 split between them. Healing increased by 30% per additional ally, up to 150%."
