WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[251787] = "Use: Unseal the urn causing the void within to pour out and engulf you for 20 sec, increasing all secondary stats by 22.\n\nAs the void dissipates, you become horrified for 5 sec. Killing an enemy while engulfed prevents this effect from occurring. (2 Min Cooldown)"
