WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[251790] = "Equip: Taking damage has a high chance to fill the chalice with Despair, drop by drop, up to 10 times. Once full, the chalice spills, blanketing the ground beneath you in a dark mire dealing 90 Void damage each second split between enemies inside for 10 sec while granting you 57 versatility."
