WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[251792] = "Equip: During combat you have a chance to become consumed by Fanatical Inspiration, increasing your highest secondary by 29 for 15 sec.\n\nParty members also equipped with the keepsake have their lowest secondary increased by 2 for 15 sec."
